  "prompt": "In a sequence, the first term is\n[Figure 1]\n. Each term after the first is\n[Figure 2]\ntimes the preceding term. Which equation gives the\n[Figure 3]\nth term,\n[Figure 4]\n, of the sequence in terms of\n[Figure 5]\n?",
